n here.", "name": "PRIYA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm Kofi. Aunt Lena's kid. From Accra.", "name": "STRANGER", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Priya stops folding.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lena's boy? You were this tall.", "name": "PRIYA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yeah. I grew.", "name": "KOFI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Dev kicks the dryer door gently.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "A sock thumps inside.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "An elderly woman, MRS. ABERNATHY (80s, cardigan, a cart of laundry), wheels past and nods at all three.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Lovely family.", "name": "MRS. ABERNATHY", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you.", "name": "PRIYA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["smiling, tired"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Kofi pulls off his headphones.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mom's going to call you tonight. She wants me to stay a week.", "name": "KOFI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We'll make room.", "name": "PRIYA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Dev grins.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "The dryers keep turning.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}